<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Farm &amp; Earn</title>
<script src="https://telegram.org/js/telegram-web-app.js"></script>
<script src="https://sad.adsgram.ai/js/sad.min.js"></script>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2d5a3d 0%,#1a3a24 100%);color:white;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding:10px;overflow-x:hidden;padding-bottom:100px}
.header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.logo{font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#00ff88}
.level-badge{background:#ff6b00;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold}
.farm-container{position:relative;width:100%;height:280px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#4a7c59 0%,#2d5a3d 100%);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;border:2px solid #00ff88;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,255,136,.2)}
.farm-background{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#3a6a4a 0,#3a6a4a 40px,transparent 40px,transparent 80px),repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#3a6a4a 0,#3a6a4a 40px,transparent 40px,transparent 80px);opacity:.5}
.farm-content{position:relative;z-index:2;width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column}
.tap-zone{width:100px;height:100px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#ffeb3b,#ffc107);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:50px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(255,235,59,.4);transition:all .1s;user-select:none}
.tap-zone:active{transform:scale(.85);box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(255,235,59,.2)}
.tap-count{position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px}
.farm-level{position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0066ff,#00ccff);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold}
.crops{position:absolute;bottom:20px;left:20px;display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:24px}
.crop{animation:sway 3s ease-in-out infinite}
.crop:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.5s}
.crop:nth-child(3){animation-delay:1s}
@keyframes sway{0%,100%{transform:rotate(0)}50%{transform:rotate(3deg)}}
.stats-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px}
.stat-card{background:rgba(0,0,0,.4);border:1px solid #00ff88;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center}
.stat-card h3{font-size:11px;opacity:.7;margin-bottom:6px}
.stat-card .value{font-size:24px;font-weight:bold;color:#00ff88}
.stat-card .sub{font-size:10px;opacity:.6;margin-top:4px}
.progress-section{background:rgba(0,0,0,.4);border:1px solid #00ff88;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.progress-section h3{font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.progress-bar{width:100%;height:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}
.progress-fill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#00ff88,#00ccff);width:0%;transition:width .3s}
.nav-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);padding:8px;border-radius:12px;overflow-x:auto}
.nav-tab{flex:1;min-width:80px;padding:10px;border:none;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:white;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;transition:all .3s;white-space:nowrap}
.nav-tab.active{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00ff88,#00ccff);color:#000}
.section{display:none}
.section.active{display:block}
.section-content{background:rgba(0,0,0,.4);border:1px solid #00ff88;padding:14px;border-radius:12px}
.section-content h2{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#00ff88;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.btn{width:100%;padding:12px;border:none;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00ff88,#00ccff);color:#000;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;transition:all .2s;margin-top:10px}
.btn:active{transform:scale(.95)}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
input,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border:none;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);color:white;margin-top:8px;border:1px solid #00ff88;font-size:12px}
input::placeholder{color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)}
.input-group{margin-bottom:8px}
.label{font-size:11px;opacity:.7;display:block;margin-bottom:4px}
.earnings-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff6b00,#ff8f00);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;text-align:center}
.earnings-card .label{opacity:.9;color:white}
.earnings-card .value{font-size:32px;font-weight:bold;color:white;margin:8px 0}
.earnings-card .sub{font-size:11px;opacity:.8}
.withdraw-options{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.withdraw-option{background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);border:2px solid #00ff88;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;font-size:12px}
.withdraw-option.selected{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00ff88,#00ccff);color:#000;font-weight:bold}
.withdraw-option:active{transform:scale(.95)}
#popup{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:rgba(0,0,0,.9);display:none;justify-content:center;align-items:center;z-index:9999;padding:20px}
.popup-content{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a3a24,#2d5a3d);border:2px solid #00ff88;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;max-width:90%;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(0,255,136,.3)}
.popup-content h2{margin-bottom:12px;color:#00ff88}
.popup-content p{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:16px;opacity:.9;white-space:pre-line}
.popup-buttons{display:flex;gap:8px}
.popup-buttons button{flex:1;padding:10px;border:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}
.popup-buttons .confirm{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00ff88,#00ccff);color:#000}
.popup-buttons .cancel{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);color:white}
.daily-slots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.daily-slot{aspect-ratio:1;background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);border:2px solid #00ff88;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer}
.daily-slot.completed{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00ff88,#00ccff);color:#000}
.disclaimer{background:rgba(255,165,0,.2);border:1px solid #ffa500;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:10px;opacity:.85;margin-top:10px;line-height:1.4}
@keyframes floatUp{0%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-40px)}}
.float-text{animation:floatUp 1s ease-out forwards}
.bonus-challenge{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(242,169,59,.15),rgba(34,195,166,.15));border:1px solid rgba(255,165,0,.5);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:12px}
.bonus-challenge h3{color:#f2a93b;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold}
.bonus-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.bonus-stat{background:rgba(0,0,0,.4);border:1px solid #00ff88;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-size:11px}
.bonus-stat .label{opacity:.7;margin-bottom:4px}
.bonus-stat .value{font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#00ff88}
.bonus-progress-bar{width:100%;height:6px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:10px}
.bonus-progress-bar>div{height:100%;width:0%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f2a93b,#22c3a6);transition:width .3s}
.bonus-note{font-size:10px;color:#f2a93b;opacity:.8;margin-bottom:8px}
.adsgram-section{background:rgba(0,0,0,.4);border:1px solid #00ff88;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.adsgram-section h3{font-size:12px;color:#00ff88;margin-bottom:8px}
.adsgram-block-id{font-size:9px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);margin-top:8px}
.watch-ad-btn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff6b00,#ff8f00);margin-bottom:8px}
.task-btn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6b00ff,#00a8ff);margin-bottom:8px}
.task-tap-btn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00ccff,#00ff88);margin-bottom:8px}
.referral-btn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9c27b0,#e91e63);margin-bottom:8px}
.task-block-container{display:none;background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);border:1px solid #00ccff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:12px}
.task-block-container.active{display:block}
#joinPopup{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:rgba(0,0,0,.85);display:none;justify-content:center;align-items:center;z-index:10000;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;padding:20px}
#joinPopup h2{color:#00ff88;font-size:24px}
#joinPopup button{padding:14px 20px;border:none;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00ff88,#00ccff);color:#000;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px}
#joinPopup button:active{transform:scale(.96)}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:120px;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);background:#1a2230;border:1px solid #00ff88;color:white;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:all .25s ease;z-index:999;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4);max-width:88%;text-align:center}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}
.bonus-button-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.bonus-button-row button{padding:10px;border:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;transition:all .2s}
.bonus-button-row button:active{transform:scale(.95)}
.bonus-button-row button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="header">
  <div class="logo">🌾 Farm &amp; Earn</div>
  <div class="level-badge">Lv. <span id="level">1</span></div>
</div>

<div class="farm-container">
  <div class="farm-background"></div>
  <div class="farm-content">
    <div class="tap-count">Taps: <span id="farmTaps">0</span></div>
    <div class="tap-zone" id="tapZone">🌾</div>
    <div class="crops"><div class="crop">🌻</div><div class="crop">🌱</div><div class="crop">🌿</div></div>
    <div class="farm-level">
      <div style="font-size:10px;opacity:.8">Farm Level</div>
      <div style="font-size:18px"><span id="farmLevel">1</span>/60</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="earnings-card">
  <div class="label">💎 Total Coins Earned</div>
  <div class="value" id="coins">0</div>
  <div class="sub">~₦<span id="coinsNGN">0</span></div>
</div>

<div class="stats-grid">
  <div class="stat-card"><h3>👆 Total Taps</h3><div class="value" id="totalTaps">0</div><div class="sub">Lifetime</div></div>
  <div class="stat-card"><h3>🏆 Rank</h3><div class="value" id="rank">Bronze</div><div class="sub">Starter</div></div>
</div>

<div class="progress-section">
  <h3><span>Farm Progress</span><span id="progressPercent">0%</span></h3>
  <div class="progress-bar"><div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill"></div></div>
</div>

<div class="nav-tabs">
  <button class="nav-tab active" onclick="switchTab('farm')">🎮 Farm</button>
  <button class="nav-tab" onclick="switchTab('tasks')">✅ Tasks</button>
  <button class="nav-tab" onclick="switchTab('daily')">🎁 Daily</button>
  <button class="nav-tab" onclick="switchTab('withdraw')">💳 Withdraw</button>
</div>

<div class="section farm active">
  <div class="section-content">
    <h2>🌾 Farm System</h2>
    <button class="btn" id="tapBtn">TAP FOR COINS +1</button>
    <button class="btn" id="plantBtn">Plant Crop +5 (Costs 10 coins)</button>
    <button class="btn" id="harvestBtn">Harvest Farm +50</button>
    <div class="progress-section" style="margin-top:12px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);border:1px solid #00ccff">
      <h3><span>Next Harvest</span><span id="harvestTime">--:--</span></h3>
      <div class="progress-bar"><div class="progress-fill" id="harvestProgress"></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section tasks">
  <div class="section-content">
    <h2>✅ Earn &amp; Complete Tasks</h2>
    <div class="bonus-challenge">
      <h3>🎯 Daily Bonus Challenge</h3>
      <div class="bonus-stats">
        <div class="bonus-stat"><div class="label">Watched Ads</div><div class="value" id="adsWatchedCount">0/5</div></div>
        <div class="bonus-stat"><div class="label">Offer Tasks</div><div class="value" id="offerTasksCount">0/5</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bonus-progress-bar"><div id="bonusProgressBar"></div></div>
      <div class="bonus-note" id="bonusNoteText">⭐ Complete to unlock daily bonus: +500 coins</div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom:12px">
      <button class="btn watch-ad-btn" id="watchAdBtn">📺 Watch Ad +20 coins</button>
      <p style="font-size:10px;margin-top:6px;opacity:.6;text-align:center">⏱️ Cooldown: 30 sec | Unlimited daily</p>
    </div>

    <div class="adsgram-section">
      <h3>🎁 Offer Tasks - Earn 30 coins each!</h3>
      <p style="font-size:10px;opacity:.7;margin-bottom:10px">Tap below to activate task block, then complete offers. Rewards are added after Adsgram reports completion.</p>
      <button class="btn task-tap-btn" id="activateTasksBtn" onclick="activateTaskBlocks()">📋 Activate Offer Tasks</button>
      <div class="task-block-container" id="taskBlock1">
        <p style="font-size:10px;opacity:.7;margin-bottom:8px">📊 Task Block 1 - Complete offers</p>
        <adsgram-task id="adsgramBlock" data-block-id="task-38707"></adsgram-task>
        <div class="adsgram-block-id">📋 Block ID: task-38707</div>
      </div>
      <div class="task-block-container" id="taskBlock2">
        <p style="font-size:10px;opacity:.7;margin-bottom:8px">📊 Task Block 2 - Complete more offers</p>
        <adsgram-task id="adsgramBlock2" data-block-id="task-38713"></adsgram-task>
        <div class="adsgram-block-id">📋 Block ID: task-38713</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="disclaimer">
      ⚠️ <strong>DISCLAIMER:</strong> Ads and tasks are optional. Rewards are credited to your server balance after completion is reported by the ad SDK.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section daily">
  <div class="section-content">
    <h2>🎁 Daily Bonus</h2>
    <p style="font-size:11px;opacity:.7;margin-bottom:12px" id="dailyBonusDesc">Complete 5 ads + 5 offer tasks to claim 500 bonus coins!</p>
    <div class="daily-slots">
      <div class="daily-slot" id="dailySlot0"><span id="daily0">1️⃣</span></div>
      <div class="daily-slot" id="dailySlot1"><span id="daily1">2️⃣</span></div>
      <div class="daily-slot" id="dailySlot2"><span id="daily2">3️⃣</span></div>
      <div class="daily-slot" id="dailySlot3"><span id="daily3">4️⃣</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-bar" style="margin-bottom:12px"><div class="progress-fill" id="dailyProgress"></div></div>
    <div class="bonus-button-row">
      <button class="btn watch-ad-btn" id="dailyWatchAdBtn" onclick="watchAdFromDaily()">📺 Watch Ad +20</button>
      <button class="btn task-btn" id="dailyTaskBtn" onclick="completeTaskFromDaily()">🎁 Do Task +30</button>
    </div>
    <button class="btn" id="claimBonusBtn" disabled>Claim 500 Bonus Coins</button>
    <p style="font-size:10px;margin-top:10px;opacity:.6" id="dailyReqText">Requirements: 5 ads watched + 5 offer tasks completed</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section withdraw">
  <div class="section-content">
    <h2>💳 Withdraw Earnings</h2>
    <p style="font-size:12px;margin:12px 0;opacity:.8">💰 <strong id="withdrawBalance">0</strong> coins available</p>

    <div class="input-group">
      <label class="label">Select Payment Method</label>
      <div class="withdraw-options">
        <div class="withdraw-option" onclick="selectMethod('usdt')">💵 USDT</div>
        <div class="withdraw-option" onclick="selectMethod('litecoin')">Ł Litecoin</div>
        <div class="withdraw-option" onclick="selectMethod('payeer')">💳 Payeer</div>
        <div class="withdraw-option" onclick="selectMethod('bank')">🏦 Bank</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="input-group"><label class="label">Wallet Address</label><input id="wallet" placeholder="Enter wallet address" type="text"></div>
    <div class="input-group"><label class="label">Amount (Min: 15000 coins = ₦15,000)</label><input id="amount" placeholder="Enter amount" type="number" min="15000"></div>

    <div style="background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:11px">
      <div>📊 Exchange Rate: 1 Coin = ₦1</div>
      <div style="margin-top:4px">You'll receive: ₦<span id="convertedAmount">0</span></div>
    </div>

    <button class="btn" id="withdrawBtn">WITHDRAW NOW</button>
    <p style="font-size:10px;margin-top:12px;opacity:.6;text-align:center">✅ Withdrawal requests are submitted for review.</p>

    <div class="disclaimer">⚠️ <strong>DISCLAIMER:</strong> Withdrawal terms and conditions apply. Requests are submitted for review. Ensure your wallet address is correct before submission.</div>

    <div style="margin-top:16px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,255,136,.2)">
      <h2 style="font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#00ff88">👥 Invite Friends</h2>
      <p style="font-size:11px;opacity:.7;margin-bottom:12px">Earn 50 coins for each friend who joins!</p>
      <input id="refLink" readonly type="text" style="margin-bottom:8px" value="">
      <button class="btn referral-btn" id="copyRefBtn" onclick="copyReferralLink()">📋 Copy Referral Link</button>
      <button class="btn referral-btn" id="shareRefBtn" onclick="shareReferralLink()" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff6b00,#ff8f00)">📤 Share Referral Link</button>
      <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-top:10px">⚠️ <strong>DISCLAIMER:</strong> Referral rewards require server-side referral processing.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="popup">
  <div class="popup-content">
    <h2 id="popupTitle">Message</h2>
    <p id="popupMessage"></p>
    <div class="popup-buttons">
      <button class="cancel" onclick="closePopup()">Close</button>
      <button class="confirm" id="popupConfirm" onclick="closePopup()">OK</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="joinPopup">
  <h2>Join Our Channel</h2>
  <button id="joinBtn">Join Channel +5 coins</button>
</div>

<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<script>
const API_URL = 'https://playmxbot.xyz/api';
const CONFIG = {
  AD_REWARD:20, ADS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS:5, AD_COOLDOWN_SEC:30, AD_DAILY_CAP:999,
  TASK_REWARD:30, TASKS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS:5, TASK_COOLDOWN_SEC:30, TASK_DAILY_CAP:999,
  DAILY_BONUS_AMOUNT:500, JOIN_CHANNEL_REWARD:5, REFERRAL_REWARD:50,
  MIN_WITHDRAWAL:15000, EXCHANGE_RATE:1, TAP_REWARD:1, PLANT_COST:10,
  PLANT_REWARD:5, HARVEST_REWARD:50, HARVEST_COOLDOWN_MS:300000
};

const tg = window.Telegram?.WebApp || null;
const WATCH_AD_BLOCK_ID = '38705';
const JOIN_CHANNEL_AD_BLOCK_ID = '38706';
let gameState = null;
let rewardAd = null;
let joinAd = null;
let selectedMethod = 'usdt';
let toastTimer = null;
let taskCompletionPending = false;
let actionQueue = Promise.resolve();

if (tg) {
  try {
    tg.ready();
    tg.expand();
    tg.setBackgroundColor?.('#1a3a24');
    tg.setHeaderColor?.('#1a3a24');
  } catch (error) {
    console.warn('Telegram setup warning:', error);
  }
} else {
  console.warn('Open this app inside Telegram to authenticate.');
}

function toast(message) {
  const element = document.getElementById('toast');
  element.innerText = message;
  element.classList.add('show');
  clearTimeout(toastTimer);
  toastTimer = setTimeout(() => element.classList.remove('show'), 2800);
}

function showPopup(title, message) {
  document.getElementById('popupTitle').innerText = title;
  document.getElementById('popupMessage').innerText = message;
  document.getElementById('popup').style.display = 'flex';
}

function closePopup() {
  document.getElementById('popup').style.display = 'none';
}

function createFloatText(text, color) {
  const element = document.createElement('div');
  element.innerText = text;
  element.className = 'float-text';
  Object.assign(element.style, {
    color, position:'fixed', left:'50%', top:'50%',
    transform:'translateX(-50%)', fontSize:'20px',
    fontWeight:'bold', pointerEvents:'none', zIndex:'999'
  });
  document.body.appendChild(element);
  setTimeout(() => element.remove(), 1000);
}

async function apiPost(endpoint, data = {}) {
  if (!tg?.initData) {
    throw new Error('Open the app inside Telegram to authenticate.');
  }

  let response;
  try {
    response = await fetch(`${API_URL}/${endpoint}.php`, {
      method:'POST',
      headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},
      body:JSON.stringify({...data, initData:tg.initData})
    });
  } catch (error) {
    throw new Error('Cannot reach Hostinger API. Check internet, CORS, and API URL.');
  }

  let result;
  try {
    result = await response.json();
  } catch {
    throw new Error(`API returned a non-JSON response (HTTP ${response.status}). Check the PHP error log.`);
  }

  if (!response.ok || !result.ok) {
    throw new Error(result.error || `API request failed (HTTP ${response.status}).`);
  }

  return result;
}

function applyPlayer(player) {
  gameState = {
    coins:Number(player.coins || 0),
    totalTaps:Number(player.total_taps || 0),
    farmLevel:Number(player.farm_level || 1),
    lastHarvest:Number(player.last_harvest || 0),
    adsWatchedToday:Number(player.ads_watched_today || 0),
    offerTasksCompletedToday:Number(player.offer_tasks_completed_today || 0),
    lastAdTime:Number(player.last_ad_time || 0),
    lastTaskTime:Number(player.last_task_time || 0),
    bonusClaimedToday:player.bonus_claimed_today || ''
  };

  if (player.selected_method) selectedMethod = player.selected_method;
  updateUI();
}

async function loadPlayer() {
  try {
    const result = await apiPost('state');
    applyPlayer(result.player);
    generateReferralLink();
    setActionButtonsEnabled(true);
    return true;
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('Player load failed:', error);
    setActionButtonsEnabled(false);
    showPopup('Could not load game', error.message);
    return false;
  }
}

function setActionButtonsEnabled(enabled) {
  ['tapBtn','plantBtn','harvestBtn','watchAdBtn','dailyWatchAdBtn',
   'dailyTaskBtn','claimBonusBtn','withdrawBtn'].forEach(id => {
    const button = document.getElementById(id);
    if (button) button.disabled = !enabled;
  });

  if (gameState) updateDailyBonus();
}

function performAction(action) {
  const request = actionQueue.then(async () => {
    const result = await apiPost('action', {action});
    applyPlayer(result.player);
    return result;
  });

  actionQueue = request.catch(() => {});
  return request;
}

function generateReferralLink() {
  const id = tg?.initDataUnsafe?.user?.id;
  document.getElementById('refLink').value =
    id ? `https://t.me/Promoteaffibot?start=${id}` : '';
}

function updateUI() {
  if (!gameState) return;

  document.getElementById('coins').innerText = gameState.coins;
  document.getElementById('coinsNGN').innerText = gameState.coins * CONFIG.EXCHANGE_RATE;
  document.getElementById('totalTaps').innerText = gameState.totalTaps;
  document.getElementById('farmLevel').innerText = gameState.farmLevel;
  document.getElementById('farmTaps').innerText = gameState.totalTaps % 10;
  document.getElementById('withdrawBalance').innerText = gameState.coins;
  document.getElementById('level').innerText = Math.floor(gameState.coins / 500) + 1;

  const ranks = ['Bronze','Silver','Gold','Platinum','Diamond'];
  const rankIndex = Math.min(Math.floor(gameState.coins / 5000), ranks.length - 1);
  document.getElementById('rank').innerText = ranks[rankIndex];

  const progress = (gameState.farmLevel % 10) / 10 * 100;
  document.getElementById('progressFill').style.width = `${progress}%`;
  document.getElementById('progressPercent').innerText = `${Math.round(progress)}%`;

  updateDailyUI();
  updateDailyBonus();
  updateHarvestCountdown();
  updateWithdrawOptions();
}

function updateDailyUI() {
  const completed = Math.min(4, gameState.adsWatchedToday + gameState.offerTasksCompletedToday);
  document.getElementById('dailyProgress').style.width = `${completed / 4 * 100}%`;

  for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {
    const slot = document.getElementById(`daily${i}`);
    const done = i < completed;
    slot.parentElement.classList.toggle('completed', done);
    slot.innerText = done ? '✅' : `${i + 1}️⃣`;
  }
}

function updateDailyBonus() {
  if (!gameState) return;

  document.getElementById('adsWatchedCount').innerText =
    `${gameState.adsWatchedToday}/${CONFIG.ADS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS}`;
  document.getElementById('offerTasksCount').innerText =
    `${gameState.offerTasksCompletedToday}/${CONFIG.TASKS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS}`;

  const required = CONFIG.ADS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS + CONFIG.TASKS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS;
  const completed = gameState.adsWatchedToday + gameState.offerTasksCompletedToday;
  document.getElementById('bonusProgressBar').style.width =
    `${Math.min(100, completed / required * 100)}%`;

  document.getElementById('bonusNoteText').innerText =
    `⭐ Complete to unlock daily bonus: +${CONFIG.DAILY_BONUS_AMOUNT} coins`;
  document.getElementById('dailyBonusDesc').innerText =
    `Complete ${CONFIG.ADS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS} ads + ${CONFIG.TASKS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS} offer tasks to claim ${CONFIG.DAILY_BONUS_AMOUNT} bonus coins!`;
  document.getElementById('dailyReqText').innerText =
    `Requirements: ${CONFIG.ADS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS} ads watched + ${CONFIG.TASKS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS} offer tasks completed`;

  const utcDate = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);
  const canClaim =
    gameState.adsWatchedToday >= CONFIG.ADS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS &&
    gameState.offerTasksCompletedToday >= CONFIG.TASKS_REQUIRED_FOR_BONUS &&
    gameState.bonusClaimedToday !== utcDate;

  document.getElementById('claimBonusBtn').disabled = !canClaim;
}

function updateHarvestCountdown() {
  if (!gameState) return;

  const elapsed = Date.now() - gameState.lastHarvest;
  const remaining = Math.max(0, CONFIG.HARVEST_COOLDOWN_MS - elapsed);
  const minutes = Math.floor(remaining / 60000);
  const seconds = Math.floor((remaining % 60000) / 1000);

  document.getElementById('harvestTime').innerText =
    `${minutes}:${String(seconds).padStart(2, '0')}`;

  const progress = Math.min(100, elapsed / CONFIG.HARVEST_COOLDOWN_MS * 100);
  document.getElementById('harvestProgress').style.width = `${progress}%`;
}

function updateWithdrawOptions() {
  document.querySelectorAll('.withdraw-option').forEach(element => {
    const method = element.getAttribute('onclick')?.match(/selectMethod\('([^']+)'\)/)?.[1];
    element.classList.toggle('selected', method === selectedMethod);
  });
}

document.getElementById('tapBtn').addEventListener('click', async () => {
  try {
    await performAction('tap');
    createFloatText(`+${CONFIG.TAP_REWARD}`, '#00ff88');
  } catch (error) {
    toast(error.message);
  }
});

document.getElementById('tapZone').addEventListener('click', () => {
  document.getElementById('tapBtn').click();
});

document.getElementById('plantBtn').addEventListener('click', async () => {
  try {
    await performAction('plant');
    createFloatText(`-${CONFIG.PLANT_COST} +${CONFIG.PLANT_REWARD}`, '#ff6b00');
    showPopup('🌱 Planted!', 'Your crop is growing!');
  } catch (error) {
    showPopup('Could not plant crop', error.message);
  }
});

document.getElementById('harvestBtn').addEventListener('click', async () => {
  try {
    await performAction('harvest');
    createFloatText(`+${CONFIG.HARVEST_REWARD}`, '#00ff88');
    showPopup('🎉 Harvested!', `+${CONFIG.HARVEST_REWARD} coins earned!`);
  } catch (error) {
    showPopup('Harvest not available', error.message);
  }
});

function switchTab(tab) {
  document.querySelectorAll('.section').forEach(element => element.classList.remove('active'));
  document.querySelectorAll('.nav-tab').forEach(element => element.classList.remove('active'));
  document.querySelector(`.section.${tab}`)?.classList.add('active');

  const index = {farm:0,tasks:1,daily:2,withdraw:3}[tab];
  document.querySelectorAll('.nav-tab')[index]?.classList.add('active');
}

function selectMethod(method) {
  selectedMethod = method;
  updateWithdrawOptions();
}

document.getElementById('amount').addEventListener('input', () => {
  const amount = Number.parseInt(document.getElementById('amount').value, 10) || 0;
  document.getElementById('convertedAmount').innerText = amount * CONFIG.EXCHANGE_RATE;
});

document.getElementById('withdrawBtn').addEventListener('click', async () => {
  const amount = Number.parseInt(document.getElementById('amount').value, 10);
  const wallet = document.getElementById('wallet').value.trim();
  const button = document.getElementById('withdrawBtn');

  if (!wallet) return showPopup('❌ Error', 'Enter wallet or account details.');
  if (!Number.isInteger(amount) || amount < CONFIG.MIN_WITHDRAWAL) {
    return showPopup('❌ Minimum', `Minimum withdrawal is ${CONFIG.MIN_WITHDRAWAL} coins.`);
  }

  button.disabled = true;
  try {
    const result = await apiPost('withdraw', {
      amount,
      method:selectedMethod,
      wallet
    });

    gameState.coins = Number(result.newCoins);
    updateUI();
    document.getElementById('wallet').value = '';
    document.getElementById('amount').value = '';
    document.getElementById('convertedAmount').innerText = '0';
    showPopup('✅ Request submitted', `Request #${result.withdrawalId} was submitted for review.`);
  } catch (error) {
    showPopup('❌ Withdrawal failed', error.message);
  } finally {
    button.disabled = false;
  }
});

function initializeAdsgram() {
  if (typeof window.Adsgram === 'undefined') {
    console.error('AdsGram SDK did not load.');
    return;
  }

  try {
    rewardAd = window.Adsgram.init({blockId:WATCH_AD_BLOCK_ID});
    joinAd = window.Adsgram.init({blockId:JOIN_CHANNEL_AD_BLOCK_ID});

    ['adsgramBlock','adsgramBlock2'].forEach(id => {
      const element = document.getElementById(id);
      if (!element || element.dataset.rewardListener === 'connected') return;

      element.addEventListener('reward', async () => {
        if (!taskCompletionPending) return;
        taskCompletionPending = false;

        try {
          const result = await performAction('offer_task');
          createFloatText(`+${CONFIG.TASK_REWARD} (Task)`, '#00ff88');
          toast(`✅ Task completed! +${CONFIG.TASK_REWARD} coins!`);
        } catch (error) {
          toast(`Task reward failed: ${error.message}`);
        }
      });

      element.addEventListener('onError', event => console.error('AdsGram task error:', event.detail));
      element.addEventListener('onBannerNotFound', event => console.warn('AdsGram banner not found:', event.detail));
      element.addEventListener('onTooLongSession', event => console.warn('AdsGram session too long:', event.detail));
      element.dataset.rewardListener = 'connected';
    });

    Promise.resolve(joinAd.show())
      .catch(error => console.warn('Automatic join ad did not complete:', error))
      .finally(() => {
        document.getElementById('joinPopup').style.display = 'flex';
      });
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('AdsGram initialization error:', error);
    rewardAd = null;
    joinAd = null;
  }
}

async function performWatchAd(buttonId = 'watchAdBtn') {
  if (!gameState) {
    toast('Game data has not loaded. Check the API connection.');
    return;
  }
  if (!rewardAd) {
    toast('Ad system is unavailable. Try again later.');
    return;
  }

  const button = document.getElementById(buttonId);
  button.disabled = true;
  button.innerText = '⏳ Loading Ad...';

  try {
    const adResult = await rewardAd.show();

    if (!adResult?.done) {
      toast('Ad was not completed; no reward was added.');
      return;
    }

    // Adsgram reports completion; action.php adds the reward to MySQL.
    const result = await performAction('ad');
    createFloatText(`+${CONFIG.AD_REWARD}`, '#00ff88');
    toast(`✅ +${CONFIG.AD_REWARD} coins added to your balance!`);
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('Ad/reward error:', error);
    toast(`Reward failed: ${error.message}`);
  } finally {
    button.disabled = false;
    button.innerText = `📺 Watch Ad +${CONFIG.AD_REWARD} coins`;
  }
}

document.getElementById('watchAdBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
  performWatchAd('watchAdBtn');
});
document.getElementById('dailyWatchAdBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
  performWatchAd('dailyWatchAdBtn');
});

function watchAdFromDaily() {
  performWatchAd('dailyWatchAdBtn');
}

function activateTaskBlocks() {
  taskCompletionPending = true;
  document.getElementById('taskBlock1').classList.add('active');
  document.getElementById('taskBlock2').classList.add('active');
  toast('Offer task blocks activated. Complete an offer to receive the reward.');
}

function completeTaskFromDaily() {
  taskCompletionPending = true;
  switchTab('tasks');

  setTimeout(() => {
    document.querySelector('.adsgram-section')?.scrollIntoView({
      behavior:'smooth',
      block:'center'
    });
    document.getElementById('taskBlock1').classList.add('active');
    document.getElementById('taskBlock2').classList.add('active');
    toast('Complete an offer to receive the task reward.');
  }, 300);
}

document.getElementById('dailyTaskBtn').addEventListener('click', completeTaskFromDaily);

document.getElementById('claimBonusBtn').addEventListener('click', async () => {
  const button = document.getElementById('claimBonusBtn');
  button.disabled = true;

  try {
    const result = await performAction('daily_bonus');
    createFloatText(`+${CONFIG.DAILY_BONUS_AMOUNT} BONUS`, '#ffd700');
    toast(`🎉 Daily bonus claimed! +${CONFIG.DAILY_BONUS_AMOUNT} coins!`);
  } catch (error) {
    toast(error.message);
  } finally {
    updateDailyBonus();
  }
});

document.getElementById('joinBtn').addEventListener('click', async () => {
  try {
    await performAction('join_channel');
    createFloatText(`+${CONFIG.JOIN_CHANNEL_REWARD}`, '#00ff88');
    toast(`✨ +${CONFIG.JOIN_CHANNEL_REWARD} coins added!`);
  } catch (error) {
    toast(`Join reward failed: ${error.message}`);
  }

  document.getElementById('joinPopup').style.display = 'none';
  window.open('https://t.me/FoxiTaskbot?start=ref_6910486529', '_blank', 'noopener');
});

function copyReferralLink() {
  const input = document.getElementById('refLink');
  input.select();

  if (navigator.clipboard?.writeText) {
    navigator.clipboard.writeText(input.value)
      .then(() => showPopup('✅ Copied!', 'Referral link copied to clipboard.'))
      .catch(() => {
        document.execCommand('copy');
        showPopup('✅ Copied!', 'Referral link copied to clipboard.');
      });
  } else {
    document.execCommand('copy');
    showPopup('✅ Copied!', 'Referral link copied to clipboard.');
  }
}

function shareReferralLink() {
  const link = document.getElementById('refLink').value;
  const text = `🌾 Farm & Earn - Earn Money Playing Games!\n\nJoin me!\n\n${link}`;

  if (navigator.share) {
    navigator.share({title:'Farm & Earn',text,url:link})
      .catch(error => console.log('Share cancelled or failed:', error));
  } else {
    copyReferralLink();
  }
}

function renderActivity() {
  // Retained placeholder.
}

document.getElementById('popup').addEventListener('click', event => {
  if (event.target.id === 'popup') closePopup();
});

document.getElementById('joinPopup').addEventListener('click', event => {
  if (event.target.id === 'joinPopup') {
    document.getElementById('joinPopup').style.display = 'none';
  }
});

window.addEventListener('load', async () => {
  setActionButtonsEnabled(false);
  generateReferralLink();
  initializeAdsgram();

  if (await loadPlayer()) {
    renderActivity();
    setInterval(updateHarvestCountdown, 1000);
  }
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
``` 

If “Could not load game” still appears, the page cannot reach or authenticate with `state.php`; ad rewards will also fail until that API call succeeds. Check the popup’s exact error and your PHP configuration/CORS settings.
